<slide>
  --font-heading: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif
  --heading-size: 64px
  --text-size: 26px
  --accent: #e07a5f
</slide>

<h2>A different voice</h2>

<p><c>--font-heading</c>, <c>--heading-size</c> and <c>--text-size</c> change typography for one slide.</p>

<p>Serif headings and bigger body text, straight from the <c><slide></c> block.</p>

<notes>
  Deck-wide defaults go in "vars" in deck.json.
</notes>
